<title>USA: National Vision vice chair/founder resigns.</title>
<headline>National Vision vice chair/founder resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, Ga. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Vision Associates Ltd said Friday that Edward Weiner, its vice chairman of the board, has resigned.</p>
<p>Weiner founded the company and served as chairman until May 1995, when he assumed the vice chairmanship, the company said.</p>
<p>National Vision provides eyecare products and services in host department stores in the U.S. and Mexico.</p>
</text>
